@Comment:	The tone of the conversation is friendly during this activity. In the beginning , MOT brings up how magnets can destroy tapes and the television set. Soon afterward , a conversation surrounding the purpose of the flat silver circle emerges , and Chi gives an explanation for how it works which isn't quite correct. Mot asks several questions about how things work. Towards the end of the activity Chi brings in his own magnet set , and Mot and Chi play with both sets. EXP remains in the background of the talk. Video taping does not start until later; transcription until then is solely from audio
